# Gaea's Cradle is legendary (CR 704.5j): playing a second one on turn 3 leaves Bot1 choosing which to keep. Bot1 keeps the first (the new one goes to the graveyard) and the survivor still taps for mana.

[Bot1 Deck]
Gaea's Cradle
Gaea's Cradle
Elvish Mystic
Forest x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Gaea's Cradle.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Gaea's Cradle.Play
Bot1.Choose(Gaea's Cradle)
[Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Gaea's Cradle
Bot1.Graveyard = Gaea's Cradle
